    <string name="indicator_rsi_zone_overbought">Overbought</string>
    <string name="indicator_rsi_zone_oversold">Oversold</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_accessibility">What is short selling?</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_covering_body">Buying back shares that were sold short. A falling short share signals covering — that repurchasing can spark a short-term bounce.</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_read_section">How to read it</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_support_body">Short-selling trends reveal bearish or rebound sentiment apart from price. It\'s not a standalone trade signal — just a supporting clue for reading the index.</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_support_section">Why we show this</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_support_title">A supporting clue for the index</string>
    <string name="indicator_short_info_what_body">Selling borrowed shares, betting the price will fall. A higher share means more money is betting on a decline. (Measured as short volume or short-position ratio, depending on the asset.)</string>
